      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.30 (down from ₹0.51 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.86m (down 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.59m (down 42% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 20% (down from 31% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 1% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
